    "subCategoryKey": "anesthetic-instruments",
    "description": "Product Title: Premium Dental Topical Anesthetic Gel – Comfort First\n(Insert Product Image Here)\nOverview\nStart every procedure with confidence and ease. Our premium dental Topical Gel is designed to provide rapid, effective surface anesthesia, ensuring your patient's comfort from the very first touch. It is an essential step in professional dental care, making injections and clinical procedures much more manageable and stress-free for your patients. 🦷✨\nWhy Choose Our Topical Gel?\n Rapid Onset: Formulated for quick absorption to minimize soft tissue sensitivity within seconds.\n Patient-Friendly Taste: Available in pleasant flavors to ensure a comfortable experience without an unpleasant aftertaste.\n Non-Drip Formula: The optimized gel consistency ensures it stays exactly where you apply it, preventing unnecessary spread or dripping.\n Gentle & Safe: A mild, effective formula designed for safe, repeated use on oral mucosa.\n Versatile Application: Perfect for pre-injection anesthesia, periodontal cleaning, gum procedures, or any surface-level treatment requiring topical numbness.\nTechnical Specifications\n Formula: High-potency, fast-absorbing anesthetic gel.\n Consistency: Non-drip, professional-grade gel.\n Usage: Clinical and dental office application.",
