    "code": "flowble-alpha-",
    "name": "Flowble Alpha",
    "arabicName": "Flowble Alpha",
    "price": 290,
    "categoryKey": "year-4-th",
    "subCategoryKey": "flowble-composite",
    "description": "Flowable Composite (Alpha) – Ultimate Adaptability & Aesthetics\nDiscover the secret to smoother, more resilient, and highly aesthetic restorations. Flowable Composite (Alpha) is engineered to provide exceptional handling, seamless shade integration, and long-lasting durability for both everyday conservative restorations and advanced cosmetic procedures.\nKey Features:\n Superior Flowability: Adapts effortlessly to cavity preparations and reaches fine margins without trapping air bubbles.\n Chameleon Shade Matching: Blends smoothly with natural tooth structures for a flawless, highly aesthetic finish.\n High Wear Resistance: Delivers excellent mechanical strength and durability under daily clinical loads.\n Fluoride Release: Provides added protection against secondary caries and supports surrounding tissue health.\n Easy and Fast Application: Optimizes chairside time with smooth, non-slumping handling.",
    "arabicDescription": "Flowable Composite (Alpha) – Ultimate Adaptability & Aesthetics\nDiscover the secret to smoother, more resilient, and highly aesthetic restorations. Flowable Composite (Alpha) is engineered to provide exceptional handling, seamless shade integration, and long-lasting durability for both everyday conservative restorations and advanced cosmetic procedures.\nKey Features:\n Superior Flowability: Adapts effortlessly to cavity preparations and reaches fine margins without trapping air bubbles.\n Chameleon Shade Matching: Blends smoothly with natural tooth structures for a flawless, highly aesthetic finish.\n High Wear Resistance: Delivers excellent mechanical strength and durability under daily clinical loads.\n Fluoride Release: Provides added protection against secondary caries and supports surrounding tissue health.\n Easy and Fast Application: Optimizes chairside time with smooth, non-slumping handling.",
