    "price": 60,
    "categoryKey": "year-4-th",
    "subCategoryKey": "operative",
    "description": "Amalgam Capsules for Mechanical Trituration—Save for Practice, Shine in Exams! \n\nPre-dosed powder and liquid capsules, ready to go straight into the Amalgamator for instant, effortless mechanical mixing. It gives you the perfect homogenous mix for your Operative restoration requirements within seconds.\n\nThe Smartest Strategy to Manage Your Budget:\n\n    Economy Egyptian Grade (For Daily Lab Practice): The most budget-friendly option in the market. Ideal for practicing as much as you want on acrylic teeth during normal lab sections without overspending.\n\n    Premium Imported Grade (Reserved for Exams): We highly recommend getting \"2 pieces\" of a high-end brand to keep in your locker for exam day. This ensures perfect condensation, smooth carving, and top grading from your instructor.\n\n Stay fully prepared while saving your budget! Order your practice and exam capsules today!",
    "arabicDescription": "Amalgam Capsules for Mechanical Trituration—Save for Practice, Shine in Exams! \n\nPre-dosed powder and liquid capsules, ready to go straight into the Amalgamator for instant, effortless mechanical mixing. It gives you the perfect homogenous mix for your Operative restoration requirements within seconds.\n\nThe Smartest Strategy to Manage Your Budget:\n\n    Economy Egyptian Grade (For Daily Lab Practice): The most budget-friendly option in the market. Ideal for practicing as much as you want on acrylic teeth during normal lab sections without overspending.\n\n    Premium Imported Grade (Reserved for Exams): We highly recommend getting \"2 pieces\" of a high-end brand to keep in your locker for exam day. This ensures perfect condensation, smooth carving, and top grading from your instructor.\n\n Stay fully prepared while saving your budget! Order your practice and exam capsules today!",
