    "code": "med-dental-a2",
    "name": "Med Dental A2",
    "arabicName": "Med Dental A2",
    "price": 230,
    "categoryKey": "year-4-th",
    "subCategoryKey": "composite-",
    "description": "MedDental Universal Restorative Composite\nA versatile universal restorative composite engineered to provide clinicians and dental students with precise handling and dependable clinical performance across all cavity classes.\nKey Features:\n Smooth, Non-Sticky Handling: Excellent sculptable consistency that does not stick to instruments, allowing effortless anatomical shaping.\n High Mechanical Durability: Formulated to resist occlusal wear and compressive forces in posterior restorations.\n Low Polymerization Shrinkage: Helps minimize post-operative sensitivity and maintains strong, leak-resistant marginal seals.\n Natural Shade Blending: Offers high polishability and translucency that blend seamlessly with natural tooth enamel.\n Universal Application: Ideal for Class I, II, III, IV, and V cavity restorations.",
    "arabicDescription": "MedDental Universal Restorative Composite\nA versatile universal restorative composite engineered to provide clinicians and dental students with precise handling and dependable clinical performance across all cavity classes.\nKey Features:\n Smooth, Non-Sticky Handling: Excellent sculptable consistency that does not stick to instruments, allowing effortless anatomical shaping.\n High Mechanical Durability: Formulated to resist occlusal wear and compressive forces in posterior restorations.\n Low Polymerization Shrinkage: Helps minimize post-operative sensitivity and maintains strong, leak-resistant marginal seals.\n Natural Shade Blending: Offers high polishability and translucency that blend seamlessly with natural tooth enamel.\n Universal Application: Ideal for Class I, II, III, IV, and V cavity restorations.",
